Subject: Faculty Attention Language Formation

Description: Signed formation contract for verbose faculty semantics, condensed attention directives, terminal-style attention loading, and compilation of an Observer coordination program.

Status: Migration input pending recompilation against SOP_Attention_First_Language_Foundation.sop. Faculty meanings remain useful, but this syntax and its irreducible faculty structure are not runtime authority.

